# Build contexts are the whole workspace — without this, every image build ships
# every node_modules directory and every dist/ into the daemon before a single
# layer is cached. The install happens INSIDE the image, from the lockfile.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
*.log
.env*
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
